          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Mama Lisa was born from a personal longing-a response to the absence of African stories and aesthetics in the everyday. Founder Lionel Njefi grew up in Cameroon, surrounded by tradition, spirit, and artistic richness. After moving to Europe and traveling across North America, he noticed how rarely African culture showed up in the spaces people live in. Mama Lisa was created to change that to bring heritage and identity into form through artful design that makes culture feel at home, wherever you are.</p>",
